### Layer 2: Group Coordination & Dynamic Consensus

#### Table: `trip_groups`
Core trip group container and lifecycle tracker.
- `id`: `UUID` | Primary Key, DEFAULT `gen_random_uuid()`
- `name`: `VARCHAR(150)` | NOT NULL
- `cover_image_url`: `TEXT` | NULLABLE
- `created_by`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `users.id` ON DELETE RESTRICT
- `status`: `TripStatus` | NOT NULL, DEFAULT `'planning'` (`planning`, `ongoing`, `completed`, `archived`)
- `trip_start_date`: `DATE` | NULLABLE
- `trip_end_date`: `DATE` | NULLABLE
- `chat_retention_deadline`: `DATE` | NULLABLE (`trip_end_date + INTERVAL '5 days'`)
- `preserve_chat`: `BOOLEAN` | NOT NULL, DEFAULT `false`

#### Table: `group_members`
Membership junction table with Role-Based Access Control (RBAC).
- `id`: `UUID` | Primary Key, DEFAULT `gen_random_uuid()`
- `group_id`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `trip_groups.id` ON DELETE CASCADE
- `user_id`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `users.id` ON DELETE CASCADE
- `role`: `Role` | NOT NULL, DEFAULT `'member'` (`creator`, `admin`, `member`)
- `joined_at`: `TIMESTAMPTZ` | NOT NULL, DEFAULT `CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`

#### Table: `group_consensus_profiles`
Shared profile combining constraints and group centroid vector.
- `id`: `UUID` | Primary Key, DEFAULT `gen_random_uuid()`
- `group_id`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `trip_groups.id` ON DELETE CASCADE, UNIQUE
- `computed_budget_range`: `JSONB` | NULLABLE
- `hard_constraints`: `JSONB` | NULLABLE (Aggregated health, dietary, transit limits)
- `consensus_vector`: `VECTOR(384)` | NULLABLE (Centroid computed by FastAPI)
- `last_edited_by`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `users.id` ON DELETE SET NULL
- `is_locked_by_admin`: `BOOLEAN` | NOT NULL, DEFAULT `false`

