### Layer 3: Ephemeral Chat, Media & Persistent AI Knowledge Base

#### Table: `messages`
Real-time group chat messages (ephemeral, subject to 5-day retention cleanup).
- `id`: `UUID` | Primary Key, DEFAULT `gen_random_uuid()`
- `group_id`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `trip_groups.id` ON DELETE CASCADE
- `sender_id`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `users.id` ON DELETE SET NULL (Nullable for system notes)
- `message_type`: `MessageType` | NOT NULL, DEFAULT `'text'` (`text`, `image`, `receipt_upload`, `poll`, `ai_system`)
- `content`: `TEXT` | NOT NULL
- `created_at`: `TIMESTAMPTZ` | NOT NULL, DEFAULT `CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`

#### Table: `polls`
Group decision-making polls.
- `id`: `UUID` | Primary Key, DEFAULT `gen_random_uuid()`
- `group_id`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `trip_groups.id` ON DELETE CASCADE
- `created_by`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `users.id` ON DELETE RESTRICT
- `question`: `TEXT` | NOT NULL
- `status`: `PollStatus` | NOT NULL, DEFAULT `'open'` (`open`, `closed`)
- `poll_vector`: `VECTOR(384)` | NULLABLE (Generated on poll completion by FastAPI)

#### Table: `poll_options`
Individual choices for a poll.
- `id`: `UUID` | Primary Key, DEFAULT `gen_random_uuid()`
- `poll_id`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `polls.id` ON DELETE CASCADE
- `option_text`: `VARCHAR(255)` | NOT NULL

#### Table: `poll_votes`
Member votes cast on poll options.
- `id`: `UUID` | Primary Key, DEFAULT `gen_random_uuid()`
- `poll_id`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `polls.id` ON DELETE CASCADE
- `option_id`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `poll_options.id` ON DELETE CASCADE
- `user_id`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `users.id` ON DELETE CASCADE

#### Table: `interaction_embeddings`
Long-term context vector storage retained after raw chat messages expire.
- `id`: `UUID` | Primary Key, DEFAULT `gen_random_uuid()`
- `group_id`: `UUID` | Foreign Key $\to$ `trip_groups.id` ON DELETE CASCADE
- `source_type`: `VARCHAR(50)` | NOT NULL (`poll_result`, `chat_preference_snippet`, `receipt_summary`)
- `source_id`: `UUID` | NULLABLE (Reference to `poll_id` or `expense_id`)
- `summary_text`: `TEXT` | NOT NULL
- `context_vector`: `VECTOR(384)` | NULLABLE

