## 4. System Boundaries & Operations

1. **Single Vector Authority**: Only the FastAPI microservice interacts directly with vector columns (`preference_vector`, `consensus_vector`, `destination_vector`, `poll_vector`, `context_vector`) via SQLAlchemy and `pgvector`. Node.js reads/writes relational structures via Prisma.
2. **Ephemeral Purge Rules**: When `CURRENT_DATE > chat_retention_deadline` and `preserve_chat = false`, the daily cron job purges `messages` and local receipt images (`/storage/receipts/{group_id}`). Financial records (`expenses`, `expense_splits`, `settlements`), photo galleries (`trip_memories`), itineraries (`itineraries`), and semantic embeddings (`interaction_embeddings`) are permanently retained.
